<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tadiran Telecom started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tadiran Telecom started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it started coverage of Tadiran Telecommunications Ltd with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Estimates earnings at $1.72 per share in 1997 and $2.00 in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Assigned 12-month target price of $24-$30 per share, or 12-15 times 1998 earnings.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/4 to 18.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
